# airgenome .convergence — 수렴 attr 기록
# format: single-file, 엔트리 단위로 @state 로 트래킹. JSON/JSONL/xattr 금지.

[cl-fresh-default]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: ~/.zshrc :: claude() wrapper (cl alias)
@decision: default=fresh (option A)
@prior: 2026-04-19 ROI#1 — `cl` 자동 `-c` 주입 (cache hit 극대 목적)
@why-reverted: 새 터미널에서 `cl` 치면 직전 세션 전체가 딸려와 context 부풀림. "갑자기 전부 메모리가 이어져 · 엉망이네" (user, 2026-04-20).
@effect:
  - `cl`                 → fresh (새 세션)
  - `cl -c|--continue`   → 이어감 (명시)
  - `cl --resume`        → resume picker
  - `cl --session-id ID` → 특정 세션
  - `cl --new`           → no-op (backward compat, 기본이 이미 fresh)
@file: ~/.zshrc:38-64
@rollback: 이 커밋의 diff 역적용 + claude() 안 `fwd=(-c "${fwd[@]}")` 복원


[cx-mac-cwd-restore]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: bin/cx :: mac local exec branch
@bug: 다른 cwd (예: ~/Dev/hexa-lang) 에서 `cl` 하면 claude TUI 가 `~/Dev/airgenome` 에서 열림.
@cause: cx 진입 직후 `cd "$ROOT"` (airgenome) 로 이동해 hexa 모듈 resolve. remote 분기는 ssh 명령에 `cd $CALLER_CWD` 주입해 복원하는데 mac local 분기 `command claude ...` 는 복원 없이 실행 → airgenome 상속.
@fix: mac 분기를 subshell 로 감싸 `( cd "$CALLER_CWD" && command claude ... )` — rc 는 subshell exit 로 자연히 전파.
@file: bin/cx:940-945
@regression-test: `cd ~/Dev/hexa-lang && cl` → TUI banner 의 cwd 가 `~/Dev/hexa-lang` 인지 확인.

[session-defaults-gap-drill-chain]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: .session_defaults :: [FANOUT] F6, [LOOP] L3/L5/L6/L7
@decision: gap/blocker/exhaustion detect triggers unified DRILL_GAP fan-out across FANOUT and LOOP planes
@changes:
  - F6 DRILL_GAP: on {blocker | scaffold-gap | catalog-exhaustion | milestone exit-criteria met}, fire N>=3 nexus drill seeds + BG scaffold for predicted next-layer unblocker in ONE message; divergent angles (minimal-surface / alt-path / next-layer-predict / adjacent-speculation); never serialize, never ask
  - L3 BUDGET: F6 DRILL_GAP burst exempt from 5-agent cap (gap/exhaustion breakthrough counted as single unit)
  - L5 HEARTBEAT: new required fields G=drill-gaps-active, P=pivots-triggered
  - L6 CHAIN: on blocker-breakthrough or milestone-completion within tick, fire F6 DRILL_GAP for next layer in SAME tick (no ScheduleWakeup delay) — chain breakthroughs compress roadmap ETA
  - L7 EXHAUST_PIVOT: on tick start with empty TaskList + empty active milestones + empty blocker queue, DO NOT end loop — fire F6 DRILL_GAP with pivot angles (next-layer-predict / adjacent-speculation / roadmap-unblock); exhaustion is transition signal, only explicit user halt (L4) terminates
@why: 2026-04-20 session observed CLM hxblas + stage0 chain-breakthroughs via ad-hoc drill fan-out (#27 r5-a6 BLAS 88-site swap → 3.5x speedup; #32 stage0 5min rebuild → TRAINER spawn). User confirmed pattern ("gap 있을 때 돌파하는데 좋더라구") and requested codification for both ad-hoc use and /loop continuity ("고갈시까지 ... 다음단계로 나갈수도 있어야"). Prior prompt lacked: (a) drill-fanout as first-class primitive, (b) exhaustion-as-pivot semantics in loop, (c) breakthrough chaining within a single tick.
@effect:
  - any gap/blocker/exhaustion event → immediate N-way divergent drill + preemptive next-layer scaffold, parallel, no approval gate
  - /loop never self-terminates on empty queue — it pivots via drill to discover next-layer work
  - breakthroughs compound within a tick instead of waiting one wakeup interval per layer
  - heartbeat exposes drill-gap and pivot counters, forcing visibility of the pattern in telemetry
@file: .session_defaults:18-22,37
@rollback: revert this commit; F6 removal also nullifies L3-exception and L6/L7 semantics (they reference F6)

[claudx-loop-infinite-wait-fix]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: bin/claudx-loop :: restart-on-exit circuit breaker
@bug: 새 `cl` 세션이 thinking/process 표시 없이 silent 무한대기 (user: "새세션에서 thinking 등 과정없이 무한대기 버그 조사 · 무결점 0 까지 개선").
@cause-chain:
  - A. rc!=0 + dur<3s 연속 실패 (e.g. `claude -c` → "No deferred tool marker" · "Not logged in" · "Error: Input must be provided with --print") 를 claudx-loop 가 일시 crash 로 판단해 영구 재시작.
  - B. rc=0 + dur<10s (--help · --version · 빠른 /quit) 도 clean-break 미적용, burst-cap 300s cooldown 후 재시작.
  - C. TUI 는 stderr 를 안 봄 (rc.log 로만) → 시각적 완전 silent = "thinking 없이 무한대기" 로 인지.
  - D. 35 고아 claudx-loop (ppid=1) 누적 — 터미널 종료 시 HUP 을 트랩만 하고 sleep 300s 완료까지 대기하는 설계로 self-terminate 지연 + cx_sessions 2893개 폭주.
@fix:
  - (B) rc=0 은 항상 clean_exit_break. dur>=10 조건 제거.
  - (A) rc!=0 && rc!=3 && dur<CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_DUR(def 3) 이 CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_MAX(def 5) 회 연속이면 fastfail_break + stderr 에 rc.log 경로 안내.
  - (D) 고아 ppid=1 loop 35개 + 자식 sleep 전부 SIGKILL (live claude 자손 없는 것만). 향후는 A+B 로 self-reap.
@evidence-smoke:
  - `CLAUDX_NO_WATCH=1 claudx-loop --help` → rc=0 clean_exit_break 즉시 종료 (before: 무한).
  - `CLAUDX_NO_WATCH=1 CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_MAX=3 claudx-loop --bogus` → 3회 fast-fail 후 "복구불가 상태로 판단, 종료" stderr + rc=0 (before: 무한).
  - orphan claudx-loop(ppid=1) post-reap = 0 (before: 35).
@file: bin/claudx-loop:34-40 / :74 / :123-133 / :137-152
@env-toggles:
  - CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_MAX — 연속 fast-fail cap (default 5)
  - CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_DUR — fast-fail 간주 최대 dur 초 (default 3)
@zero-defect:
  - silent-hang 경로 = 0 (rc=0 any-dur → break; rc!=0 dur<3 x5 → break; rc=130 → break; rc=3 → exhausted-sleep 분기)
  - 고아 loop 누적 = 0 (기존 reap + 향후 self-reap)
@rollback: bin/claudx-loop 의 2026-04-20 패치 역적용 + 이전 `rc=0 && dur>=10` 조건 복원

@__raw__
